@startuml 03-componentes-backend
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title Componentes — backend Flask (`code/backend/server.py` y producción)

component [Flask App\n(CORS)] as Flask

interface "HTTP / JSON" as HTTP

component [Rutas de ingesta\nPOST /api/ingest] as Ingest
component [Rutas de consulta\nGET /api/latest/{id}\nGET /api/history/{id}\nGET /api/stats/{id}] as Query
component [Mantenimiento\nPOST /api/clear] as Clear
component [UI legada opcional\nGET / (dashboard HTML)] as LegacyUi
component [Capa de persistencia\nsqlite3] as Repo
database "Archivo SQLite" as File

HTTP - Flask
Flask -down- Ingest
Flask -down- Query
Flask -down- Clear
Flask -down- LegacyUi
Ingest -down-> Repo : INSERT
Query -down-> Repo : SELECT
Clear -down-> Repo : DELETE / limpieza
LegacyUi ..> Repo : opcional\n(rutas separadas)

Repo -right- File

note right of Ingest
  Acepta payload "anidado"
  (sensor + data) y formato legado
  en la raíz.
end note

@enduml
